                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_apa rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_apa rendering_contributiontojournal_apa">Bancroft, A., Squirrell, T., Zaunseder, A., &amp; Rafanell, I. (2019). <a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research-portal.uws.ac.uk/en/publications/producing-trust-among-illicit-actors-a-techno-social-approach-to-/" class="link"><span>Producing trust among illicit actors: a techno-social approach to an online illicit market</span></a>. <span><em>Sociological Research Online</em></span>. Advance online publication. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1177/1360780419881158" class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1177/1360780419881158</span></a></div>
